WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.046
LawFilings: legal drafting, law referencing and filing, made easy.

2
00:00:07.646 --> 00:00:15.680
Real, assembled drafts, downloadable as a PDF, with no blank brackets left to fill in.

3
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:24.120
Wizards built on real procedure check deadlines, jurisdiction and eligibility before you draft.

4
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:33.862
Full coverage: district courts in every state and union territory, plus High Courts, the Supreme Court and tribunals.

5
00:00:34.462 --> 00:00:41.495
Track your cases yourself. Save a case and add status updates over time.

6
00:00:42.095 --> 00:00:49.818
Over three hundred Acts and the Constitution, curated for litigation and sourced from primary text.

7
00:00:50.418 --> 00:00:56.409
So how does it work? Four steps, not a blank page.

8
00:00:57.009 --> 00:01:03.561
One: answer plain questions, in simple words or precise legal phrasing.

9
00:01:04.161 --> 00:01:13.041
Two: or upload what you have, an FIR, notice, order or complaint, and we fill in what we can.

10
00:01:13.641 --> 00:01:19.607
Three: we catch deadlines and gaps before you draft, not after.

11
00:01:20.207 --> 00:01:27.580
Four: get your assembled draft, ready to download as a PDF or Word document.

12
00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:32.948
LawFilings. Start your filing today.
